                                                        DESCRIPTION:The benefits of physical fitness extend beyond the individual to have a positive impact on society as a whole. A fit and healthy population tends to have lower healthcare costs, reduced absenteeism from work, and a greater overall productivity. Moreover, fitness can promote a sense of community as people come together in group activities like sports, fitness classes, or team workouts.
